   438	- **C1 — Vastin's age.** No numeric age for Vastin appears in plan, packet, narration or dialogue; "forty years" is career length only. OWNER #8/#17 govern. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 11] OWNER-DECISIONS #8/#17 default: *age never stated; career "forty years"*. **Edition: no stated age.** "Forty years" is kept as his own rounding (ruling 20). *Owner ruling welcome; it does not block.*
   439	- **C2 — Academy-era spans given as numbers.** Examples: "The Compact spent four years trying to file this boy" (S2); "I read your file for four years" (S7); the cache carried "four years" (S11, S16); "in the four years Cael had known him" (S5); "it took four years and a hearing" (S8, a fixed line). These sit against the locked timeline (Kindling at fourteen, academy from about sixteen) and OWNER-DECISIONS #9/#18 ("since his Kindling", no number, for B4–B6). **Edition:** no numeric span since Kindling. Anchor academy/cache spans to events; office survey records may keep their own six-year rounding where explicitly identified as the office's. The protected S8 four-year line remains word for word under [OWNER-pending #53] and is never repeated as fact. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 11]
   440	- **C3 — Oryn's days past her road.** S20 has "two days past the end of the road that had been hers" (305th) and S23 "three days past" (307th). The cairn where her road turns north is on the 300th, which makes them five and seven days. **Edition: count from the cairn**, or drop the number.
   441	- **C4 — The grandmother.** The universe ledger lists "Hesk's grandmother" as the owner of the straightedge saying. Book 7 edition chapter 60's note (chapter-60.md:67) [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 11] ("Your grandmother said…") and S17/S24 make her **Cael's** grandmother, Hesk's late wife. **Edition follows the prose.** The ledger line is a slip.
   442	- **C5 — Rune's tier.** The universe bible says "Cael's twelfth (Rune-adjacent, partial, Bronze)". The notice says "Rune family … Tier equivalent unknown". **Edition follows the notice.** Bronze is Cleon's tier.
   443	- **C6 — Architecture residue.** The architecture's header, plant ledger and checkpoint still say Cael turns twenty in Ch14, the terminus is "the Still Court", and there is a "sixth" site. **Superseded** by rulings 12 and 13 and by the closed prose: nineteen throughout, "the court", the fifth.
