   111	He filed it. He filed the fellow-feeling, which was the strangest thing he had felt in a year that had had a good deal of strange in it — that he and the Compact's own held line had a thing in common now, on a landing, and the thing was a door that neither of their names would open — and he pushed the iron, and it went in on its pins without a sound, and the lamp went ahead of him into the dark, and he picked up the box.
