No scene is densely tracked: chapter 26 scenes 2 and 4 each contain one local tracked passage, and every other scene contains none. No scene-level reconstruction is needed. The two local entry/order changes above are sufficient to break the remaining author-prose inheritance without disturbing plan-required events or protected text.

