+
+The requested calibrated probe reported a 2% skeleton rate and a 14% close rate. Its exact and strongest pairs are protected S10–S12 dialogue, notices and log text, manuscript placeholders for those protected units, or short common constructions. The nominally highest scenes are therefore not author-prose source-distance failures. The finding below comes from the side-by-side read.
+
+## 1. Verdict
+
+**One genuine tracked passage in the movement.** It is local to chapter 27, scene 2. No scene is densely tracked.
+
+| Chapter | Scene 1 | Scene 2 | Scene 3 | Scene 4 | Scene 5 | Scene 6 | Chapter total |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 27 | 0 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | **1** |
